[00:09.07]1. A multitude is gathering
[00:18.14]from ev’ry tribe and nation,
[00:25.14]Collected by the Christ and his
[00:29.14]anointed congregation.
[00:33.14]God’s Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[00:38.14]We pray his will be done on earth.
[00:42.14]This hope is a gift of priceless worth,
[00:44.40]Giving joy and consolation.
[00:47.90](Chorus)
[00:51.40]Praise our God, Jehovah; Praise his Son forever—
[00:54.96]King of all kings and the Lord of lords.
[00:59.96]Now unitedly we bow to his rule
[01:03.84]And praise him with one accord.
[01:14.88]2. We praise the Christ, our reigning King,
[01:18.38]with sounds of jubilation.
[01:21.88]This Prince of Peace will be our Judge
[01:30.88]and bring about salvation.
[01:33.88]We see the joys that lie ahead:
[01:36.88]An earth released from fear and dread;
[01:40.99]The time for our Lord to raise the dead.
[01:44.49]What a time for exultation!
[01:46.74](Chorus)
[01:48.99]Praise our God, Jehovah; Praise his Son forever—
[01:54.99]King of all kings and the Lord of lords.
[01:57.99]Now unitedly we bow to his rule
[02:01.99]And praise him with one accord.